<p>An Egyptian mother and her five children were taken back into federal custody on April 25, less than two days after a federal judge ordered their release from more than 10 months in US immigration detention, according to the family&#x27;s lawyers. The family, identified as Hayam El Gamal and children ages 5 to 18, had been freed under court orders and returned home before authorities detained them again during what lawyers described as a required check-in. Later that day, a judge blocked the family&#x27;s deportation and ordered that they be returned to Colorado, according to reporting on the case.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Length held: Lawyers said the El Gamals were the longest-held family in US immigration detention, spending more than 10 months in custody before this week&#x27;s court-ordered release.</li><li>Who detained them: The family&#x27;s legal team and reports on the case said ICE carried out the re-arrest.</li><li>Children affected: The children range in age from 5 to 18, underscoring that the detention dispute involves school-age minors as well as their mother.</li><li>Rapid reversal: Lawyers said authorities detained the family again within 48 hours of the release order.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Family&#x27;s legal team: The lawyers said federal authorities took the family back into custody just hours after they returned home following their release from detention. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/4/25/family-longest-held-in-us-immigration-detention-re-arrested-after-release'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li><li>Federal judge: A judge blocked the family&#x27;s deportation and ordered that they be returned to Colorado. (<a href='https://www.wsws.org/en/articles/2026/04/25/cucf-a25.html'>World Socialist Web Site</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/ice-detains-family-less-than-two-days-after-court-ordered-their-release-lawyers-say'>ICE detained family less than two days after court ordered their release</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/4/25/family-longest-held-in-us-immigration-detention-re-arrested-after-release'>Family longest held in US immigration detention re-arrested after release</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.wsws.org/en/articles/2026/04/25/cucf-a25.html'>El Gamal family being returned to Colorado following judicial order blocking deportation</a> - wsws.org</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/04/ice-detains-family-less-two-days-after-court-ordered-their-release-lawyers-say'>ICE detains family less than two days after court ordered their release, lawyers say</a> - al-monitor.com</li></ul>